    "detailed_description": "Telluria: Forebodings Gear Minigame is a short puzzle game involving logical challenges. The player is expected to solve riddles with textual or visual hints and put clues together in a logical way, in order to arrive at the correct solution in various levels of difficulty.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588220/extras/47dd1646097a28144beb5a793b20bff8.avif?t=1718801536\" width=200 height=396 /></span><br><br>Annelise, the main character in the upcoming Telluria: Forebodings, is needing your help to open the bulkheads of the watermill (1st Age) / library (3rd Age), thus advancing in her quest for the Pyrite Talisman. Solve the puzzles and turn the gears in the correct order to win. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588220/extras/ad3511d63934569d533ade2c5175b27a.avif?t=1718801536\" width=500 height=280 /></span><br><br>Get involved in her destiny and support the main game. Your journey on Telluria starts here.",
